# Sweet Corner 🍰
Personal text-based bakery management simulator developed in C#.

## About
Sweet Corner is a beginner-friendly management game where players run their own bakery.

Players will manage money, purchase ingredients, bake products, serve customers and expand their business.

## Technologies
- C#
- .NET

## Project Status
In development.

## Features
- [x] Welcome screen
- [x] Initial bakery statistics
- [ ] Ingredient management
- [ ] Baking system
- [ ] Product sales
- [ ] Bakery upgrades
- [ ] Save and load system